{"id":"vorsprung","lemma":"Vorsprung","pos":"noun","rank":4216,"glosses":["projection, prominence, protrusion","ledge","salient"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/94/De-Vorsprung.ogg/De-Vorsprung.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Vorsprunges","plural":"Vorsprünge"},"examples":[{"text":"Wir haben drei Spiele Vorsprung.","en":"We have a three-game lead.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"a game","l":"Spiel"},null]},{"text":"Ich könnte ebenso gut auch einen Vorsprung bekommen.","en":"I might as well get a head start.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"equally, as much"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"also"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]},{"text":"Tom ließ mir einen Vorsprung.","en":"Tom gave me a head start.","words":[null,{"g":"to allow","l":"lassen"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Wir wissen, dass die andere Mannschaft gewinnen wird. Die Frage ist nur, mit welchem Vorsprung.","en":"We know the other team will win. The only question is by how much.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to know"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"another , others","l":"anderer"},{"g":"crew members of a ship"},{"g":"to win"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"which","l":"welcher"},null]}]}